msgid ""
"Check managed accounts each hour. Suspend access and end sessions when "
"directory checks confirm removal or lost access. Keep user content."
msgstr "每小时检查受管理账户。当目录检查确认账户已移除或访问权限已丢失时，暂停访问并结束会话。保留用户内容。"

